Downstream consumers of this report, so write for them: task 012 (FR-01 server — the identity resolver extending /api/documents), task 013 (FR-01 client — the `canGetDocumentUrl` capability and `getDocumentUrl()` on IHostAdapter), and task 014 (FR-02 stamp), whose scope changes materially on an AMBER or RED verdict.</notes>

